---
args: { decisions: DecisionAtom[], prepared: PreparedEvidence, input: CaseInput }
returns: DraftGardenAgreement
---
Construct a GardenAgreement draft with its actual domain fields. Only supported values enter `values`; preserve conflicts, missing fields and evidence bindings. Apply supplied allocation principles to feasible plans and propose fair compromises for contested plots or duties. Distinguish a suggestion from accepted responsibility and use reversible trials where preferences conflict without a clear rule-based resolution.
